	(text "SPI module, not UART T variant. MCU controls RXEN; DIO2 controls TXEN through R501.\nRXEN low during TX/sleep; set DIO2 RF-switch control in firmware. 3.3 V supply, budget 124 mA TX.\nSTART: 915 MHz, SF7 / 125 kHz / CR4/5, +14 dBm, 60 s packet interval.\nDo not fit/use two antennas: R506 connects board U.FL; remove R506 if using module IPEX.\nPin 12 = GND, pin 15 = NRST per official E22-M V1.5 (2026-09-18), not the erroneous web pin table.\nInternal DIO3 TCXO supply = 2.2 V per official manual 4.2; initial startup delay 5 ms, verify at temperature.\nPCB: short 50-ohm RF trace, continuous GND, antenna keepout, close C501/C502/C503/C505.\nD501: bidirectional 5 V / 0.25 pF RF ESD at U.FL; C504 DNP tuning. Verify RF loss and ESD on PCB."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.00 205.00 0)
		(effects (font (face "Courier New") (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "759a0c6e-36f8-4d32-9871-cd090d498043")
	)
